ress><country>JP</country> </address> </addressbook> </applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA TOMOSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IMAI, OSAMU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATO, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIMURA, AKIHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIN-ETSU HANDOTAI CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMATSUKA, MASARO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, TOMOSUKE</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IMAI OSAMU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KATO MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIMURA AKIHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAMATSUKA MASARO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA TOMOSUKE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IMAI, OSAMU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATO, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIMURA, AKIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAMATSUKA, MASARO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIDA, TOMOSUKE</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A CZ silicon wafer containing therein a bar-like cavity defect and/or plate-like cavity defect. And, a CZ silicon wafer containing therein a cavity defect, wherein a maximum ratio (L1/L2) of a longer-side length (L1) to a shorter-side length (L2) in an appropriate rectangle circumscribing around a cavity defect image projected on an appropriate {110} plane is at least 2.5. And, a silicon wafer containing therein a bar-like cavity defect and/or plate-like cavity defect, wherein a density of the part of the cavity defect extending from the wafer surface to a depth of at least 0.5  mu m is up to 1/2 that inside the wafer. Accordingly, a silicon wafer is obtained that is suitable for expanding into a deeper region an effect of reducing a heat treatment-caused cavity defect.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une plaquette de silicium CZ présentant à l'intérieur un défaut de cavité, du type barre, et/ou un défaut de cavité du type plaque. Elle concerne également une telle plaquette contenant un tel défaut et caractérisée en ce que le rapport maximal (L1/L2) entre la longueur d'un côté long (L1) et la longueur d'un côté court (L2) d'un rectangle approprié circonscrivant une image du défaut de cavité, projetée sur un plan adéquat (110), est d'au moins 2,5. L'invention concerne encore une plaquette de silicium présentant à l'intérieur un défaut de cavité du type barre et/ou plaque, la densité de la partie du défaut de cavité s'étendant entre la surface de la plaquette et une profondeur d'au moins 0,5  mu m, pouvant représenter jusqu'à la moitié de celle de l'intérieur de la plaquette. En conséquence, on obtient ainsi une plaquette de silicium conçue pour dilater, dans une région plus profonde, un effet d'une réduction d'un défaut de cavité provoqué par un traitement thermique</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>